# Const

Product copy lives in `modules/{context}/consts/texts.const.ts`. Copy shared by several modules lives in `apps/web/src/client/modules/shared/consts/texts.const.ts`. No inline product copy in components.

```ts
export const texts = {
  signIn: {
    title: "Sign in",
    description: "Use the email you signed up with.",
  },
} as const;
```

Other constants go in the same folder with the `.const.ts` suffix (`onboarding-step.const.ts`).
